    wr:{title:"The logbook entry", brief:"Write a closing entry on a year of work or study. Part one: what you have achieved and what you finished at specific times. Part two: what you will have achieved by a date you set, and what you would like to have done by then.", length:"13 sentences · about 190 words", criteria:["Four present perfects with open time periods and three simple pasts with finished time.","Two future perfects tied to a named deadline.","One “would like to have + past participle”."]},
